L-AIO110\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\", \"category\": \"all-in-one\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-aio110.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 3000, \"highPrice\": 25000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.25mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"450 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"3840 x 2160 (4K UHD)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the resolution and pixel pitch of the All-in-One 110\\\" Conference display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features a 3840 x 2160 (4K) resolution with a fine pixel pitch of 1.25mm, delivering sharp and clear visuals ideal for detailed presentations and video conferencing.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the All-in-One 110\\\" Conference compare to traditional LCD displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional LCDs, this Micro LED display offers a seamless, bezel-less design with higher durability and superior color accuracy at 450 nits brightness. It is designed to replace legacy LCD video walls with better visual performance and modularity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is touch functionality available on this model?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display supports an optional IR touch overlay, enabling interactive presentations and collaboration in meeting rooms and huddle spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation options are available for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The All-in-One 110\\\" Conference supports flexible mounting options including wall mounting and stands, allowing easy integration within various meeting environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What operating systems are supported by this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It runs on Android 14 and Tizen OS, providing compatibility with popular conferencing apps and smart meeting room features.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical power consumption of this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The typical power consumption is 350W, which is efficient for a 110-inch Micro LED display, ensuring energy savings in prolonged use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty coverage and professional after-sales support to ensure long-term reliability and customer satisfaction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of rooms or spaces is this display best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for meeting rooms and huddle spaces requiring high clarity and interactive capabilities, making it an excellent choice for corporate environments and executive offices.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"All-in-One 110\\\" Conference\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>All-in-One 110&quot; Conference</h1><p>Discover the All-in-One 110&quot; Conference LED Display. Perfect for UAE businesses. Boost meetings with premium visuals. Contact Brightluxx Dubai now!</p><p><strong>The LCD killer for meeting rooms.</strong></p><p>110-inch Micro LED conference display replacing legacy LCD video walls. Bezel-less, modular 600x337mm panels. Built-in touch overlay option, camera mount, and smart conferencing OS.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the resolution and pixel pitch of the All-in-One 110&quot; Conference display?</h3><p>The display features a 3840 x 2160 (4K) resolution with a fine pixel pitch of 1.25mm, delivering sharp and clear visuals ideal for detailed presentations and video conferencing.</p><h3>How does the All-in-One 110&quot; Conference compare to traditional LCD displays?</h3><p>Unlike traditional LCDs, this Micro LED display offers a seamless, bezel-less design with higher durability and superior color accuracy at 450 nits brightness. It is designed to replace legacy LCD video walls with better visual performance and modularity.</p><h3>Is touch functionality available on this model?</h3><p>Yes, the display supports an optional IR touch overlay, enabling interactive presentations and collaboration in meeting rooms and huddle spaces.</p><h3>What installation options are available for this LED display?</h3><p>The All-in-One 110&quot; Conference supports flexible mounting options including wall mounting and stands, allowing easy integration within various meeting environments.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__nex