lay features a 3840 x 2160 (4K) resolution with a fine pixel pitch of 1.25mm, delivering sharp and clear visuals ideal for detailed presentations and video conferencing.</p><h3>How does the All-in-One 110&quot; Conference compare to traditional LCD displays?</h3><p>Unlike traditional LCDs, this Micro LED display offers a seamless, bezel-less design with higher durability and superior color accuracy at 450 nits brightness. It is designed to replace legacy LCD video walls with better visual performance and modularity.</p><h3>Is touch functionality available on this model?</h3><p>Yes, the display supports an optional IR touch overlay, enabling interactive presentations and collaboration in meeting rooms and huddle spaces.</p><h3>What installation options are available for this LED display?</h3><p>The All-in-One 110&quot; Conference supports flexible mounting options including wall mounting and stands, allowing easy integration within various meeting environments.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"All-in-One 110\\\" Conference LED Display in Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover the All-in-One 110\\\" Conference LED Display. Perfect for UAE businesses. Boost meetings with premium visuals. Contact Brightluxx Dubai now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/bl-aio110\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"para