ds.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\", \"category\": \"all-in-one\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-aio110.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 3000, \"highPrice\": 25000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.25mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"450 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"3840 x 2160 (4K UHD)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta2f,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the resolution and pixel pitch of the All-in-One 110\\\" Conference display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features a 3840 x 2160 (4K) resolution with a fine pixel pitch of 1.25mm, delivering sharp and clear visuals ideal for detailed presentations and video conferencing.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the All-in-One 110\\\" Conference compare to traditional LCD displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional LCDs, this Micro LED display offers a seamless, bezel-less design with higher durability and superior color accuracy at 450 nits brightness. It is designed to replace legacy LCD video walls with better visual performance and modularity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is touch functionality available on this model?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display supports an optional IR touch overlay, enabling interactive presentations and collaboration in meeting rooms and huddle spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation options are available for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The All-in-One 110\\\" Conference supports flexible mounting options including wall mounting and stands, allowing easy integration within various meeting environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What operating systems are supported by this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It runs on Android 14 and Tizen OS, providing compatibility with popular conferencing apps and smart meeting room features.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical power consumption of this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The typical power consumption is 350W, which is efficient for a 110-inch Micro LED display, ensuring energy savings in prolonged use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty coverage and professional after-sales support to ensure long-term reliability and customer satisfaction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of rooms or spaces is this display best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for meeting rooms and huddle spaces requiring high clarity and interactive capabilities, making it an excellent choice for corporate environments and executive offices.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}]