 higher durability and superior color accuracy at 450 nits brightness. It is designed to replace legacy LCD video walls with better visual performance and modularity.</p><h3>Is touch functionality available on this model?</h3><p>Yes, the display supports an optional IR touch overlay, enabling interactive presentations and collaboration in meeting rooms and huddle spaces.</p><h3>What installation options are available for this LED display?</h3><p>The All-in-One 110&quot; Conference supports flexible mounting options including wall mounting and stands, allowing easy integration within various meeting environments.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"All-in-One 110\\\" Conference LED Display in Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover the All-in-One 110\\\" Conference LED Display. Perfect for UAE businesses. Boost meetings with premium visuals. Contact Brightluxx Dubai now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T585,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"All-in-One 110\\\" Conference\", \"description\": \"110-inch Micro LED conference display replacing legacy LCD video walls. Bezel-less, modular 600x337mm panels. Built-in touch overlay option, camera mount, and smart conferencing OS.\", \"sku\": \"BL-AIO110\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-aio110\", \"category\": \"all-in-o